# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets headers (the control plane serves this
# client at the site root). The SharedArrayBuffer audio ring buffer needs a
# cross-origin isolated page; without these two headers the player cannot
# start (Agent Note 2026-04-04-canvas-playback-engine).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
